     "body": "<p>The issue was discussed here <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/2018-09-13+-+Fedora+Tech+Meeting.\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/2018-09-13+-+Fedora+Tech+Meeting.</a>  The team was comfortable with keeping things as is.  The following issue was created to address the remaining concerns raised in the discussion: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2865\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2865</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
